# scrape caches. sg_rows.jsonl is NOT among them: it is the append-only log the
# scraper writes as it goes and the only record of what StoryGraph said, and
# sgmerge.py reads it rather than the cache. isfdb_cache.json and series_wd.json
# were treated as regenerable, were never committed, and are gone — allseries.py
# has not been able to fill a bibliography since. sg_cache.json stays ignored
# because it rewrites whole and reconstructs from the log exactly.
sg_cache.json
sg_todo.json
sg_calib.json
